    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> alexcrichton created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14962#discussion_r4363529829\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Ah ok, not worth a <code>#[test]</code> IMO, but this might be runnable by having another component which calls this component with a borrow perhaps? I think the <code>host</code> interface has some sort of resource-creation functionality.</p>\n</blockquote>",
